  m_text: "Movement: W, A, S, D\nInventory: E\nChest: F\n\nYou must have a weapon
    in your hotbar to attack.\nSelect it using the number row (1\u20130), then click
    on an enemy. If the enemy is in range, the cursor turns colored; otherwise, it's
    grayscaled.\nThe same applies to healing potions, but you don't need to click
    on an enemy to use them.\n\nOn the stairs, wait 1 second to be teleported to
    the next floor."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
